  "title": "Solstice Advanced Materials to Announce Second Quarter 2026 Financial Results on July 30, 2026",
  "summary": "MORRIS PLAINS, N.J., July 17, 2026 /PRNewswire/ -- Solstice Advanced Materials (NASDAQ: SOLS) (\"Solstice\" or \"the Company\") will issue its second quarter financial results before market open on July 30, 2026. The Company will also hold a conference call to discuss the results at 8:30 a.m. ET.",
